/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-03-29T02:18:01Z","updated_at":"2019-03-29T02:18:01Z","body":"Some observations:\r\n```\r\n[yugabyte@ip-172-151-25-83 ~]$ ps -ef | grep postgres\r\nyugabyte 11074 31432  0 02:00 ?        00:00:00 [postgres]\r\nyugabyte 11076 10888  0 02:00 pts/0    00:00:00 grep --color=auto postgres\r\nyugabyte 19255 25507 15 Mar27 ?        06:48:51 postgres: postgres postgres 172.151.30.86(50384) INSERT\r\nyugabyte 19256 25507 15 Mar27 ?        06:49:36 postgres: postgres postgres 172.151.30.86(50386) INSERT\r\nyugabyte 19273 25507 21 Mar27 ?        09:23:53 postgres: postgres postgres 172.151.30.86(50412) idle\r\nyugabyte 25507     1  0 Mar27 ?        00:00:00 /home/yugabyte/yb-software/yugabyte-ee-1.2.2.0-b2-centos-x86_64/postgres/bin/postgres -D /mnt/d0/pg_data -p 5433 -h 172.151.25.83 -k  -c logging_collector=on -c log_directory=/mnt/d0/yb-data/tserver/logs\r\nyugabyte 25518 25507  0 Mar27 ?        00:00:00 postgres: logger\r\nyugabyte 25520 25507  0 Mar27 ?        00:00:00 postgres: checkpointer\r\nyugabyte 25521 25507  0 Mar27 ?        00:00:31 postgres: stats collector\r\n```\r\nWhen we launch the postgres process from the tserver, we should store its pid somewhere (ideally independently from postgres's own pidfile), and then on tserver restart we need to kill the postgres process if it is still running.","author_association":"CONTRIBU