T18:04:24Z","body":"@ndeodhar: we need to parameterize the `Subprocess` class to be able to customize the signal that the child process would receive on parent process termination, and as @robertpang mentioned, we need to set that signal to `SIGINT` for the PostgreSQL child process.\r\n\r\nSee this in `subprocess.cc`:\r\n```\r\n    // TODO: prctl(PR_SET_PDEATHSIG) is Linux-specific, look into portable ways\r\n    // to prevent orphans when parent is killed.\r\n    prctl(PR_SET_PDEATHSIG, SIGTERM);\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/481799658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mbautin","id":552936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjkzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/552936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin","html_url":"https://github.com/mbautin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2266928690,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjI2NjkyODY5MA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/2266928690","actor":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu